{# props: options — خيارات المنتج (مقاس/لون/حقل نصي...) كما تُعيدها سلة لكل منتج #}
<form class="product-options space-y-5 mb-6" data-component="product-options">
    {% for option in options %}
        <div class="option-group">
            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2.5">
                {{ option.name }} {% if option.required %}<span class="text-accent">*</span>{% endif %}
            </label>

            {% if option.type == 'color' %}
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
                    {% for value in option.values %}
                        <label class="option-color-swatch w-9 h-9 rounded-full border-2 border-transparent has-[:checked]:border-accent cursor-pointer" style="background-color: {{ value.color|default('#ccc') }}">
                            <input type="radio" name="options[{{ option.id }}]" value="{{ value.id }}" class="sr-only" {% if not value.available %}disabled{% endif %}>
                        </label>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            {% elseif option.type == 'thumbnail' %}
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
                    {% for value in option.values %}
                        <label class="option-thumb w-14 h-14 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-2 border-neutral-100 has-[:checked]:border-accent cursor-pointer">
                            <input type="radio" name="options[{{ option.id }}]" value="{{ value.id }}" class="sr-only">
                            <img src="{{ value.image }}" alt="{{ value.name }}" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                        </label>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            {% elseif option.type == 'text' %}
                <input type="text" name="options[{{ option.id }}]" placeholder="{{ option.placeholder|default('') }}"
                       class="w-full rounded-card border-neutral-200 focus:border-accent focus:ring-accent text-sm">
            {% else %}
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    {% for value in option.values %}
                        <label class="option-pill px-4 py-2 rounded-pill border border-neutral-200 text-sm has-[:checked]:bg-accent has-[:checked]:text-white has-[:checked]:border-accent cursor-pointer {% if not value.available %}opacity-40 pointer-events-none{% endif %}">
                            <input type="radio" name="options[{{ option.id }}]" value="{{ value.id }}" class="sr-only">
                            {{ value.name }}
                        </label>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    {% endfor %}
</form>
